msgstr "Izvori"

msgid "Sources saved successfully!"
msgstr "Izvori su uspješno spremljeni!"

msgid "Specify in which case the EPG must be automatically updated after the box has booted."
msgstr "Navedite u kojem se slučaju EPG mora automatski ažurirati nakon pokretanja okvira."

msgid "Specify the path folder for save EPG.dat file."
msgstr "Navedite mapu staze za spremanje datoteke EPG.dat."

msgid "Specify the source for EPG."
msgstr "Navedite izvor za EPG."

msgid "Specify the time for the automatic EPG update."
msgstr "Odredite vrijeme za automatsko ažuriranje EPG-a."

msgid "Standby at startup"
msgstr "Stanje pripravnosti pri pokretanju"

msgid "Start import after booting up"
msgstr "Pokrenite uvoz nakon podizanja sustava"

msgid "Start import after resuming from standby mode."
msgstr "Pokrenite uvoz nakon nastavka iz stanja pripravnosti."

msgid "Start import after standby"
msgstr "Pokreni uvoz nakon čekanja"

msgid "Sunday"
msgstr "nedjelja"

msgid "The waked up box will be turned into standby after automatic EPG import wake up."
msgstr "Probuđeni okvir će se prebaciti u stanje pripravnosti nakon buđenja automatskog uvoza EPG-a."

msgid "This is for advanced users that are using the channel id filtering feature. If enabled, the filter rules defined into /etc/epgimport/channel_id_filter.conf will also be applied on your /etc/epgimport/custom.channels.xml file."
msgstr "Ovo je za napredne korisnike koji koriste značajku filtriranja ID kanala. Ako je omogućeno, pravila filtriranja definirana u /etc/epgimport/channel_id_filter.conf također će se primijeniti na vašu datoteku /etc/epgimport/custom.channels.xml."

msgid "This will clear the current EPG data in memory before updating the EPG data. This allows you to always have a clean new EPG with the latest EPG data, for example in case of program changes between refresh, otherwise EPG data are cumulative."
msgstr "Ovo će izbrisati trenutne EPG podatke u memoriji prije ažuriranja EPG podataka. To vam omogućuje da uvijek imate čist novi EPG s najnovijim EPG podacima, na primjer u slučaju promjena programa između osvježavanja, inače su EPG podaci kumulativni."

msgid "This will turn back waked up box into deep-standby after automatic EPG import."
msgstr "Ovo će vratiti probuđenu kutiju u duboku pripravnost nakon automatskog uvoza EPG-a."

msgid "Thursday"
msgstr "četvrtak"

msgid "To save memory you can decide to load EPG data only  for theIPTV channels."
msgstr "Kako biste uštedjeli memoriju, možete odlučiti učitati EPG podatke samo za IPTV kanale."

msgid "To save memory you can decide to only load EPG data for the services that you have in your bouquet files."
msgstr "Kako biste uštedjeli memoriju, možete odlučiti učitati samo EPG podatke za usluge koje imate u svojim datotekama paketa."

msgid "Tuesday"
msgstr "utorak"

msgid "Update Sources"
msgstr "Ažuriranje izvora"

msgid "Wednesday"
msgstr "srijeda"

msgid "When enabled, it allows you to schedule an automatic EPG update at the given days and time."
msgstr "Kada je omogućeno, omogućuje vam zakazivanje automatskog ažuriranja EPG-a u zadane dane i vrijeme."

msgid "When enabled, then you can run the desired script before starting the import, after which the import of the EPG will begin."
msgstr "Kada je omogućeno, tada možete pokrenuti željenu skriptu prije pokretanja uvoza, nakon čega će započeti uvoz EPG-a."

msgid "When in deep standby"
msgstr "Kada je u dubokom stanju pripravnosti"

#, fuzzy
msgid "When you decide to import the EPG after the box booted mention if the \\\\"
msgstr "Kada odlučite uvesti EPG nakon pokretanja okvira, spomenite ako \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"

msgid "When you restart the GUI you can decide to skip or not the EPG data import."
msgstr "Kada ponovno pokrenete GUI, možete odlučiti hoćete li preskočiti ili ne uvoz EPG podataka."

msgid "Write to /tmp/epgimport.log"
msgstr "Pišite u /tmp/epgimport.log"

msgid "You can select the day(s) when the EPG update must be performed."
msgstr "Možete odabrati dan(ove) kada se ažuriranje EPG-a mora izvršiti."

msgid "You can start automatically the plugin AutoTimer after the EPG data update to have it refreshing its scheduling after EPG data refresh."
msgstr "Možete automatski pokrenuti dodatak AutoTimer nakon ažuriranja EPG podataka kako bi osvježio svoj raspored nakon osvježavanja EPG podataka."

